<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Interstellar</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Lato:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background-color: #050810;
      color: #e8e0d0;
      font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Starfield */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 55% 15%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 70% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 35%, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 20% 85%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 92% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 45% 92%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 5% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, transparent 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .card {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 0;
      max-width: 820px;
      width: 95vw;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200, 160, 80, 0.25);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,15,30,0.95) 0%, rgba(5,8,20,0.98) 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(200,150,50,0.08), 0 0 120px rgba(10,20,60,0.6);
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .poster-col {
      flex: 0 0 260px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .poster-col img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      filter: saturate(0.85) contrast(1.05);
      transition: transform 0.6s ease, filter 0.6s ease;
    }

    .card:hover .poster-col img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
      filter: saturate(1) contrast(1.1);
    }

    .poster-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 60%, rgba(5,8,20,0.95) 100%);
    }

    .info-col {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 40px 36px 36px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .meta {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #c8a050;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s 0.3s ease both;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      line-height: 1;
      color: #f0e8d8;
      text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(200,150,50,0.2);
      animation: fadeIn 1s 0.4s ease both;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 48px;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #c8a050, transparent);
      margin: 18px 0;
      animation: expand 1s 0.6s ease both;
      transform-origin: left;
    }

    @keyframes expand {
      from { transform: scaleX(0); opacity: 0; }
      to   { transform: scaleX(1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .description {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: rgba(232, 224, 208, 0.72);
      max-width: 360px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s 0.7s ease both;
    }

    .description em {
      color: #c8a050;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .bottom-row {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s 0.9s ease both;
    }

    .rating {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .rating-score {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #c8a050;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .rating-label {
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(200,160,80,0.5);
    }

    .vline {
      width: 1px;
      height: 44px;
      background: rgba(200,160,80,0.2);
    }

    .watch-btn {
      cursor: pointer;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,160,80,0.5);
      color: #c8a050;
      font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .watch-btn::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: #c8a050;
      transform: translateX(-102%);
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }

    .watch-btn:hover { color: #050810; border-color: #c8a050; }
    .watch-btn:hover::before { transform: translateX(0); }

    .watch-btn span { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .card { flex-direction: column; }
      .poster-col { flex: 0 0 220px; }
      .poster-overlay { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 60%, rgba(5,8,20,0.95) 100%); }
      .info-col { padding: 28px 24px 28px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="poster-col">
    <!-- Poster from a public domain/free-use source -->
    <img
      src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bc/Interstellar_film_poster.jpg"
      alt="Interstellar Movie Poster"
    />
    <div class="poster-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="info-col">
    <div>
      <p class="meta">2014 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sci-Fi &nbsp;·&nbsp; 169 min</p>
      <h1>Interstellar</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="description">
        When Earth's future hangs by a thread, a former NASA pilot leads a team through
        a <em>wormhole near Saturn</em> — venturing beyond our galaxy in search of a new
        home for humanity. A breathtaking odyssey that fuses hard science with raw human
        emotion, directed by <em>Christopher Nolan</em>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-row">
      <div class="rating">
        <span class="rating-score">8.7</span>
        <span class="rating-label">IMDb</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vline"></div>
      <button class="watch-btn" onclick="alert('Watch this movie!')">
        <span>Watch this movie</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
